#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:251
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:323
#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:387
msgid ""
"While everyone is welcome to try out the demos and look through the code, "
"we're aiming this release at people who are already experienced with ROS 1 "
"development. At this point, the ROS 2 documentation is pretty sparse and "
"much of the system is explained by way of how it compares to ROS 1."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:206
msgid "Improved type support infrastructure, including support for C"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/Releases/Alpha-Overview.rst:207
msgid ""
"Preliminary Python client library, only publishers and subscriptions are "
"supported. Beware, the API is subject to change and is far from complete!"
msgstr ""

